    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was created with love by two friends for you in one year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>The primary objective</strong>\u00a0is to locate the main character's missing sister, who vanished in the volcanic region. To achieve this, you must gather seven coordinates scattered across two anomalous areas: the metro and the old forest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/609a430dc33860202419fea92d5289b5.poster.avif?t=1744621525\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/609a430dc33860202419fea92d5289b5.webm?t=1744621525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/609a430dc33860202419fea92d5289b5.mp4?t=1744621525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1dThere are only <strong>handmade levels </strong>made with love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/8e1af018be54ad24aab259eb0ce5f6a9.avif?t=1744621525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0If you want to chill a little, <strong>buy</strong> some stuff or <strong>sell</strong> anomaly items, change your outfit - then you should go to the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/712b2543260079339defb5ba2bd913f4.avif?t=1744621525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b<strong>Your time</strong> within these hazardous zones is limited, as dangerous creatures await!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was created with love by two friends for you in one year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>The primary objective</strong>\u00a0is to locate the main character's missing sister, who vanished in the volcanic region. To achieve this, you must gather seven coordinates scattered across two anomalous areas: the metro and the old forest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/609a430dc33860202419fea92d5289b5.poster.avif?t=1744621525\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/609a430dc33860202419fea92d5289b5.webm?t=1744621525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/609a430dc33860202419fea92d5289b5.mp4?t=1744621525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1dThere are only <strong>handmade levels </strong>made with love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/8e1af018be54ad24aab259eb0ce5f6a9.avif?t=1744621525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0If you want to chill a little, <strong>buy</strong> some stuff or <strong>sell</strong> anomaly items, change your outfit - then you should go to the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524700/extras/712b2543260079339defb5ba2bd913f4.avif?t=1744621525\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u231b<strong>Your time</strong> within these hazardous zones is limited, as dangerous creatures await!</p>",
    "short_description": "Anomaly Living is a cooperative horror game for 1-2 players. Only you can help find Leia in this world filled with monsters and anomaly phenomena. Good luck!",
